# Excluding node_modules/dist is REQUIRED for the Docker frontend build:
# the Dockerfile runs `COPY switchbot-frontend/ ./` after `npm ci`, and without
# these excludes the host's node_modules/dist would clobber the freshly built
# ones. Do not remove these entries.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
switchbot-frontend/node_modules
switchbot-frontend/dist
